  "title": {
   "en": "Kuromaku Reijou Anastasia wa, Mou Akiramenai Futatabime no Jinsei wa Jiyuu wo Tsukamimasu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "黒幕令嬢アナスタシアは、もうあきらめない 二度目の人生は自由を掴みます"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Anastasia, a count's daughter who was mistreated by her family and died an unfortunate death. However, instead of dying, she was returned to her childhood.\n\nThis time she wants to live happily!　\n\nIn order to grasp her freedom, she uses her knowledge of the future to confront the corrupt aristocratic society. With the mysterious merchant Kai and a group of mercenaries with a sad past as her friends, her activities develop into a major incident that changes the country.\n\nThe story of a young woman who refuses to give up begins!"
  },
